[h1]Ride it, grind it, land it.[/h1]
A BMX with real physics. Lean to steer, hit the ramps, grind any rail on any map, and chain tricks into combos. No content to mount.

[quote][b]Official server:[/b]  connect gmod.naliwajka.com:27015[/quote]

[h2]Feature List[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Three bikes.[/b] The 20" BMX, a long and fast 24" Cruiser, and a quick little 16" Mini.
[*][b]Spawn menu.[/b] Type [b]/bike[/b] in chat to pick a bike or a park piece. Works on servers without the Q menu.
[*][b]Real handling.[/b] Lean to steer, pedal up ramps, and suspension that soaks up landings.
[*][b]Grinds on any map.[/b] Crank grinds on rails and double pegs on ledges, with sparks. No map setup needed.
[*][b]Tricks.[/b] Wheelies, manuals, stoppies, bunny hops, flips, barrel rolls, 360s, tailwhips and barspins.
[*][b]Style poses.[/b] Superman, can-can, no-hander, X-up and more, stacked on any flip.
[*][b]Combos.[/b] Chain airs, grinds and manuals into one line, then land it for a multiplier.
[*][b]Scoring.[/b] On-screen trick callouts, personal bests and a leaderboard.
[*][b]Game modes.[/b] SKATE, Trick Attack and Combo Mambo.
[*][b]Park pieces.[/b] 15 ramps, rails, ledges and quarter pipes in three sizes, with a snapping build tool and preset parks.
[*][b]Replays.[/b] Press J to watch your last 30 seconds from four cameras, slow it down, and save it.
[*][b]Cameras.[/b] A cinematic camera (L), a trick cam and placeable filmer cams.
[*][b]Crashes.[/b] You ragdoll off as your own player model. RagMod is supported.
[*][b]Your bike, your colour.[/b] 14 paints, or pick any colour.
[*][b]The little things.[/b] A bell, wind rush at speed, splashes in water, and standing or attack riding stances.
[*][b]A trick bot[/b] to ride with or play SKATE against.
[*][b]Gamepad support[/b] and a settings menu under Options > BMX.
[/list]

[h2]Controls[/h2]
[table]
[tr][td]W / S[/td][td]Pedal / brake (in the air: flip)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]A / D[/td][td]Lean to steer (in the air: roll)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]SPACE[/td][td]Hold and release to hop[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Right mouse[/td][td]Wheelie / manual (in the air, with A/D: spin)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Left mouse[/td][td]Stoppie (in the air, with A/D: tailwhip)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]R[/td][td]Bell (in the air or a manual: barspin)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]ALT[/td][td]Hold with W/S/A/D/SPACE for a style pose[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]SHIFT / CTRL[/td][td]Sprint / tuck[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]E / K / L / J[/td][td]Get on / paint / cinematic cam / replay[/td][/tr]
[/table]
